<p>You line your armor with explosive plating that detonates when struck. On taking a melee or ranged hit that deals more than 8% of your maximum life a plate detonates, reducing the damage taken by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 20%, 26%, 31%, 35%</acronym> and triggering a basic grenade attack in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> cone projected at the target dealing 25% of its usual damage.</p><p>This cannot trigger more than once per turn.</p><p>Blocking an attack with your shield will also trigger the retaliation damage, if it has not already triggered this turn.</p><p>You have up to 3 plates at a time, and regain one every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9, 8, 7, 6, 5</acronym> turns.</p>